/* AI-OS - "Gesso auf Leinwand".
   ------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Vorher war das hier Glas: Milchglastafeln, die über einem Sternenfeld
   schwebten. Seit fx.js wirklich malt, ist der Hintergrund kein Sternenfeld
   mehr, sondern eine Leinwand mit Farbe darauf - und Glas ist das Gegenteil
   davon: glatt, kalt, maschinell. Eine Tafel ist jetzt grundiertes Papier,
   das auf der Farbe liegt.

   Drei Regeln halten das zusammen:

   1. KEIN BLUR MEHR. backdrop-filter ist überall raus. Es war der Kern des
      Glas-Looks und ist zugleich das Teuerste am Bildaufbau - dreissig
      weichgezeichnete Flächen pro Frame sind auf einem Telefon der
      Unterschied zwischen flüssigem und ruckelndem Scrollen. Die Tafeln
      sind stattdessen deckend genug, dass der Text auf der Malerei
      steht statt in ihr.

   2. LICHT VON OBEN, SCHATTEN NACH UNTEN. Jede Tafel hat oben eine helle
      Haarlinie und unten eine dunkle (--edge-dim). Das eine Detail ist es,
      das aus einem Rechteck ein Blatt macht, das auf etwas liegt - beim Glas
      fehlte die Unterkante, weil Glas nicht aufliegt, sondern schwebt. Cards additionally carry --mx/--my, set by
      app.js on touch, for a specular highlight under the finger.

   3. DEPTH IS ORDERED. Three elevations, and they never mix: --e1 for
      resting panels, --e2 for the hero and anything focused, --e3 for
      anything that floats over the app (sheets, modals). A shadow that does
      not correspond to one of those is a mistake, not a variation.

   The palette is unchanged from the previous design - it came from a
   reference Felix chose ("Can You Grasp Time", Dogan Ural) and he asked for
   a new design, not a new subject. */

:root {
  /* Tokens only - every colour below is set per light, further down. The
     stylesheet never names a colour again after this block, which is what
     makes four palettes a data change rather than four stylesheets. */
  --r: 8px;
  --r-sm: 5px;
  --pad: 16px;
  --tabbar-h: 62px;
  --blur: saturate(140%) blur(20px);
  --e1: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
  --e2: 0 18px 44px -18px rgba(0,0,0,0.42), 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
  --e3: 0 -8px 60px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.45), 0 2px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}

/* --- the light of the hour ------------------------------------------------
   Monet painted the same haystack at dawn, noon and dusk because the light
   was the subject and the haystack was only its excuse. fx.js paints the
   canvas under four lights and stamps body[data-light]; these are the same
   four lights for everything that is not the canvas.

   Felix answered "hell muss nicht aber kann, entscheide du". This is that
   decision: both, and neither as a toggle - light in daylight, dark at two
   in the morning, and never two designs to maintain. */

body[data-light="dawn"] {
  --bg: #ced4db;
  --text: #1c2230;
  --text-dim: #4e5769;
  --text-faint: #79839a;
  --accent: #3d6b96;
  --gold: #9a7434;
  --violet: #6b5c96;
  --good: #2f6f4e;
  --bad: #9c3b3b;
  --pane: rgba(255,255,255,0.42);
  --pane-2: rgba(255,255,255,0.60);
  --pane-solid: rgba(240,242,246,0.90);
  /* Die Unterkante der Tafel: dort, wo sie auf der Farbe aufliegt. */
  --edge-dim: rgba(28,34,48,0.16);
  --edge: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
  --edge-soft: rgba(28,34,48,0.10);
  --hero-a: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
  --hero-b: rgba(214,220,229,0.66);
  --veil: radial-gradient(120% 80% at 50% 30%,
          rgba(255,255,255,0.34), rgba(206,212,219,0.10) 70%, rgba(150,160,175,0.16));
  --me-a: #3d6b96; --me-b: #2f5a80; --me-ink: #f4f8ff;
  --code-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.62);
  --scrim: rgba(60,66,78,0.42);
  --grain-blend: multiply;
  --grain-opacity: 0.05;
}

body[data-light="day"] {
  --bg: #e9e3d5;
  --text: #241f18;
  --text-dim: #5a5245;
  --text-faint: #8a8272;
  --accent: #4a6f4a;
  --gold: #8a6a25;
  --violet: #6a5b84;
  --good: #33683f;
  --bad: #9a3a30;
  --pane: rgba(255,253,247,0.46);
  --pane-2: rgba(255,253,247,0.66);
  --pane-solid: rgba(248,245,234,0.90);
  /* Die Unterkante der Tafel: dort, wo sie auf der Farbe aufliegt. */
  --edge-dim: rgba(36,31,24,0.16);
  --edge: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
  --edge-soft: rgba(36,31,24,0.10);
  --hero-a: rgba(255,253,246,0.76);
  --hero-b: rgba(226,220,203,0.68);
  --veil: radial-gradient(120% 80% at 50% 30%,
          rgba(255,252,242,0.36), rgba(233,227,213,0.10) 70%, rgba(170,162,142,0.16));
  --me-a: #4a6f4a; --me-b: #3b5c3c; --me-ink: #f6faf2;
  --code-bg: rgba(255,253,247,0.66);
  --scrim: rgba(70,64,52,0.42);
  --grain-blend: multiply;
  --grain-opacity: 0.055;
}

body[data-light="dusk"] {
  --bg: #c6a896;
  --text: #2a1d21;
  --text-dim: #5d454b;
  --text-faint: #8c6f74;
  --accent: #8c4a3c;
  --gold: #8a6320;
  --violet: #6d4f78;
  --good: #3d6a4c;
  --bad: #93302f;
  --pane: rgba(255,246,238,0.42);
  --pane-2: rgba(255,246,238,0.62);
  --pane-solid: rgba(249,236,227,0.90);
  /* Die Unterkante der Tafel: dort, wo sie auf der Farbe aufliegt. */
  --edge-dim: rgba(42,29,33,0.18);
  --edge: rgba(255,248,240,0.92);
  --edge-soft: rgba(42,29,33,0.12);
  --hero-a: rgba(255,246,236,0.74);
  --hero-b: rgba(216,184,166,0.68);
  --veil: radial-gradient(120% 80% at 50% 30%,
          rgba(255,240,222,0.32), rgba(198,168,150,0.10) 70%, rgba(120,88,80,0.20));
  --me-a: #8c4a3c; --me-b: #6f3a30; --me-ink: #fff3ec;
  --code-bg: rgba(255,246,238,0.60);
  --scrim: rgba(70,46,44,0.46);
  --grain-blend: multiply;
  --grain-opacity: 0.06;
}

/* Night is also the default: fx.js stamps the attribute on load, and until
   it does the page must still have colours. Falling back to the dark one is
   the safe direction - a flash of dark before dawn is a flash, a flash of
   nothing is an unreadable screen. */
body, body[data-light="night"] {
  --bg: #161b2b;
  --text: #e7ecf6;
  --text-dim: #96a1b8;
  --text-faint: #5f6a83;
  --accent: #b9cff0;
  --gold: #e8c98a;
  --violet: #b9a0ff;
  --good: #8fe3b0;
  --bad: #ff9a9a;
  --pane: rgba(150,178,215,0.075);
  --pane-2: rgba(160,190,230,0.11);
  --pane-solid: rgba(20,26,44,0.86);
  /* Die Unterkante der Tafel: dort, wo sie auf der Farbe aufliegt. */
  --edge-dim: rgba(0,0,0,0.38);
  --edge: rgba(200,220,255,0.20);
  --edge-soft: rgba(200,220,255,0.075);
  --hero-a: rgba(30,38,60,0.86);
  --hero-b: rgba(14,18,32,0.90);
  --veil: radial-gradient(120% 80% at 50% 30%,
          rgba(0,0,0,0.18), rgba(0,0,0,0.42) 70%, rgba(0,0,0,0.58));
  --me-a: #cfe0f8; --me-b: #a9c1e4; --me-ink: #0b1020;
  --code-bg: rgba(0,0,0,0.42);
  --scrim: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
  --grain-blend: overlay;
  --grain-opacity: 0.035;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }

html, body {
  margin: 0; padding: 0; height: 100%;
  background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
  font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  font-size: 16px;
  overscroll-behavior: none;
  /* No gradients here any more. The old design drew its sky in CSS - three
     washes and eight layers of stars - because there was nothing else to
     draw it. fx.js paints now, and two skies fighting each other is worse
     than either of them alone. */
  transition: background-color 900ms ease, color 900ms ease;
}

body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

/* The veil sits between the sky and the content: without it, bright stars
   land directly behind body text and every line gets a random speckle in it.
   Opacity is driven per screen - Today wants the sky, a data table does not. */
#fx-veil {
  position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
  background: var(--veil);
  transition: opacity 500ms ease, background 900ms ease;
}
body[data-screen="screen-today"] #fx-veil { opacity: 0.55; }
body[data-screen="screen-chat"] #fx-veil { opacity: 0.9; }
body[data-screen="screen-devices"] #fx-veil { opacity: 0.95; }
#fx-canvas { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; }

/* Grain over everything. Very low opacity: it is the difference between a
   flat gradient and one that looks like a photographed surface. */
#fx-grain {
  position: fixed; inset: -50%; z-index: 60; pointer-events: none;
  opacity: var(--grain-opacity); mix-blend-mode: var(--grain-blend);
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,\
<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='140' height='140'>\
<filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='3'/></filter>\
<rect width='140' height='140' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.55'/></svg>");
}

/* --- the glass material ------------------------------------------------ */

.glass {
  background: var(--pane-solid);
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  /* Two backgrounds through one border: the fill is clipped to the padding
     box, the lit edge to the border box. That is what draws a 1px highlight
     that is bright at the top and gone at the bottom - a uniform border
     would read as an outline, not as an edge catching light. */
  background-image: linear-gradient(var(--pane-solid), var(--pane-solid)),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--edge), var(--edge-soft) 45%, transparent);
  background-origin: border-box;
  background-clip: padding-box, border-box;
  /* Oben Licht, unten Auflage. Ohne die untere Linie sieht eine Tafel aus
     wie ein Ausschnitt, nicht wie ein Blatt, das auf der Farbe liegt. */
  box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 0 var(--edge-dim);
}

.panel {
  position: relative;
  border-radius: var(--r);
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  background-image: linear-gradient(var(--pane), var(--pane)),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--edge), var(--edge-soft) 40%, transparent 85%);
  background-origin: border-box;
  background-clip: padding-box, border-box;
  box-shadow: var(--e1);
  overflow: hidden;
}
/* The specular highlight. --mx/--my come from app.js on touch; with no touch
   yet they default to the top-left third, which is where the ambient light
   in the background gradient comes from anyway. */
.panel::before {
  content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;
  background: radial-gradient(200px 160px at var(--mx, 30%) var(--my, 0%),
              var(--edge), transparent 70%);
  opacity: 0; transition: opacity 420ms ease;
}
.panel.lit::before { opacity: 1; }

/* --- top bar ----------------------------------------------------------- */

.topbar {
  position: relative; z-index: 30;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: calc(env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px) + 10px) var(--pad) 10px;
  border-radius: 0;
  border: none;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
  background-image: none;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.brand {
  font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.98rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  color: var(--accent);
}
.topbar-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
.dot {
  width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--text-faint);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(143,227,176,0.5);
}
.dot.ok { background: var(--good); }
.dot.err { background: var(--bad); }

.cost-pill {
  font: inherit; font-size: 0.76rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  color: var(--text-dim); background: var(--pane); border: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
  border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 10px; cursor: pointer;
}
.cost-pill.warn { color: var(--gold); border-color: rgba(232,201,138,0.35); }
.icon-btn {
  display: grid; place-items: center; width: 30px; height: 30px;
  padding: 0; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer;
  color: var(--text-dim); background: var(--pane);
  border: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
}
.icon-btn svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
.icon-btn.on { color: var(--me-ink); background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }

/* The four lights, as four real swatches. A list of words would make you
   guess what "dusk" looks like; the ground colour of each palette says it
   without being read. */
.light-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; padding: 4px 0 10px; }
.light-swatch {
  flex: 1; border: 1px solid var(--edge-soft); border-radius: var(--r-sm);
  padding: 0; cursor: pointer; overflow: hidden; background: none;
  font: inherit; color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.68rem;
}
.light-swatch i { display: block; height: 46px; }
.light-swatch span { display: block; padding: 6px 2px; }
.light-swatch.on { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

.ghost-btn {
  font: inherit; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--accent);
  background: none; border: 1px solid var(--edge); border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 5px 12px; cursor: pointer;
}

/* --- screens ----------------------------------------------------------- */

#screens { position: relative; z-index: 10; flex: 1; min-height: 0; }
.screen { display: none; height: 100%; min-height: 0; }
.screen.active { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.scroll {
  flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  padding: 18px var(--pad) calc(var(--tabbar-h) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) + 28px);
}

h1 {
  font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}
h2.section-title {
  font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-faint);
  margin: 30px 0 10px;
}
.eyebrow {
  font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.hint { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 12px; }
.empty-state {
  padding: 26px 18px; text-align: center; color: var(--text-faint);
  font-size: 0.88rem;
}

/* --- hero (Today) ------------------------------------------------------- */

.hero {
  position: relative;
  border-radius: var(--r); padding: 22px 20px 20px; margin-bottom: 22px;
  background: linear-gradient(165deg, var(--hero-a), var(--hero-b));
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(165deg, var(--hero-a), var(--hero-b)),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--edge), var(--edge-soft) 45%, transparent);
  background-origin: border-box; background-clip: padding-box, border-box;
  box-shadow: var(--e2);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.hero::after {
  /* The slow light sweep. Purely decorative, and the one place it belongs:
     the single most important thing on the screen. */
  content: ""; position: absolute; top: -60%; left: -60%;
  width: 80%; height: 220%;
  background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent, var(--edge), transparent);
  transform: rotate(8deg);
  animation: sweep 9s ease-in-out 1.2s infinite;
}
@keyframes sweep {
  0%, 62% { transform: translateX(0) rotate(8deg); opacity: 0; }
  68% { opacity: 1; }
  100% { transform: translateX(320%) rotate(8deg); opacity: 0; }
}
.hero .kicker {
  font-size: 0.66rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.hero .title {
  font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.hero .meta {
  display: flex; gap: 16px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-dim);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.hero .body {
  margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 16px; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--text-dim); border-top: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
}

/* --- stat rows --------------------------------------------------------- */

.stat-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.stat-row {
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px;
  padding: 15px 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
}
.stat-row .num {
  font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  min-width: 3.2ch; text-align: right;
}
.stat-row .num.zero { color: var(--text-faint); }
.stat-row .num.hot { color: var(--accent); }
.stat-row .label { flex: 1; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-dim); }

/* --- cards / signals --------------------------------------------------- */

.cards { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 11px; }
/* Was die drei Handlungen zusammen bringen. Steht über ihnen: es ist der
   Grund, sie überhaupt anzusehen. */
.today-sub {
  font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.5;
  margin: -8px 0 16px;
}

/* Die eine Zeile, die von den fünf Zahlen übrig geblieben ist: warum die
   Handlungen oben etwas wert sind. */
.pipe-line {
  font-size: 0.78rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-dim);
  margin-top: 18px; cursor: pointer;
}
.pipe-line b { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }

/* --- Handlung zwei und drei auf "Heute" ---------------------------------
   Bewusst leiser als der Held darüber: eine Zeile, der Betrag laut daneben,
   der Grund erst beim Antippen. Alles über dieselben Tokens wie der Rest,
   damit ein Materialwechsel sie automatisch mitnimmt. */
.act {
  /* Dieselbe Deckung wie der Held darüber, nicht das halbtransparente
     --pane-2 von früher: sobald hinter einer Tafel wirklich gemalt ist,
     liest man Text auf ihr nur noch, wenn sie deckt. Im dunklen Licht war
     --pane-2 mit 0.11 Deckkraft praktisch Glas. */
  background: var(--pane-solid); border-radius: var(--r);
  padding: 12px 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  background-image: linear-gradient(var(--pane-solid), var(--pane-solid)),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--edge), transparent 70%);
  background-origin: border-box; background-clip: padding-box, border-box;
  box-shadow: var(--e1), inset 0 -1px 0 var(--edge-dim);
  cursor: pointer; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}
.act-rank {
  font-size: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
  font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-faint); margin-bottom: 5px;
}
.act-what {
  font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35;
  display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 1; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.act.open .act-what { -webkit-line-clamp: unset; overflow: visible; }
.act-cost { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; margin-top: 7px; }
.act-eur { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
           font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.act-min { font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-dim); }
.act-why {
  display: none; margin-top: 9px; padding-top: 9px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
  font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-dim);
}
.act.open .act-why { display: block; }

/* Der Griff zum Rest. Erreichbar, nicht einladend: was nicht unter den
   ersten dreien steht, ist heute nicht dran. */
.rest-handle {
  display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left;
  background: none; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
  color: var(--text-dim); font: inherit; font-size: 0.8rem;
  padding: 12px 2px; margin-bottom: 8px; cursor: pointer;
}

.card, .panel-card {
  position: relative; border-radius: var(--r); padding: 15px 16px;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  background-image: linear-gradient(var(--pane), var(--pane)),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--edge), var(--edge-soft) 40%, transparent 85%);
  background-origin: border-box; background-clip: padding-box, border-box;
  box-shadow: var(--e1);
}
.card h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; }
.card .sub { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.5; }
.card .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; }

.signals { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(96px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
.signal {
  border-radius: var(--r-sm); padding: 12px 13px;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  background-image: linear-gradient(var(--pane), var(--pane)),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--edge), transparent 70%);
  background-origin: border-box; background-clip: padding-box, border-box;
}
.signal .v {
  font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 300; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em; display: block;
}
.signal .k {
  font-size: 0.66rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-faint); margin-top: 4px; display: block;
}
.signal.good .v { color: var(--good); }
.signal.warn .v { color: var(--gold); }
.signal.bad .v { color: var(--bad); }

/* --- chips / buttons --------------------------------------------------- */

.chip-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
/* The alternatives shown when an engine runs out. Indented like a reply and
   quiet, because it is an offer, not the answer. */
.switch-row { align-self: flex-start; max-width: 92%; margin: 2px 0 6px; }
.chip {
  font: inherit; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-dim);
  background: var(--pane); border: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
  border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 14px; cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 160ms ease, color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
}
.chip:active { transform: scale(0.97); }
.chip.on {
  color: var(--me-ink); background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent);
  font-weight: 600;
}
.chip[disabled] { opacity: 0.4; }
.chip.danger { color: var(--bad); border-color: rgba(255,154,154,0.3); }

.pill-btn {
  font: inherit; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--me-ink);
  background: var(--accent); border: none; border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 10px 18px; cursor: pointer;
}
.pill-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.35; }
.pill-btn.ghost {
  color: var(--accent); background: var(--pane); border: 1px solid var(--edge);
  font-weight: 500; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.pill-btn.ghost input[type=file] { position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: 0; }
.pill-btn.wide { display: block; width: 100%; text-align: center; }

.inline-form { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.inline-form input[type=text] {
  flex: 1; min-width: 0; font: inherit; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text);
  background: var(--pane); border: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
  border-radius: var(--r-sm); padding: 11px 13px;
}
.inline-form input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--edge); }

.out {
  font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  font-size: 0.74rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--text-dim);
  background: var(--code-bg); border: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
  border-radius: var(--r-sm); padding: 12px;
  white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;
  max-height: 42vh; overflow: auto; margin: 0;
}
.out:empty { display: none; }

/* --- tables ------------------------------------------------------------ */

.table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; margin-bottom: 8px; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 0.82rem; }
th, td { text-align: left; padding: 10px 12px 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--edge-soft); }
th {
  font-size: 0.64rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-faint); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;
}
td { color: var(--text-dim); }
td.num, th.num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; padding-right: 0; }
td strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

/* --- chat -------------------------------------------------------------- */

.chat-screen { padding: 0 var(--pad); }
.session-bar {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; width: 100%;
  margin: 12px 0 4px; padding: 11px 14px; border-radius: var(--r-sm);
  font: inherit; text-align: left; color: var(--text); cursor: pointer;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.session-title { flex: 1; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.session-meta { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-faint); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.session-bar .chev { width: 16px; height: 16px; color: var(--text-faint); flex-shrink: 0; }
.session-bar.live .session-title::after {
  content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; margin-left: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%; background: var(--good); vertical-align: middle;
  animation: pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes pulse { 0%,100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.25; } }

.chat-log {
  flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  padding: 12px 0 6px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;
}
/* A short conversation sits at the bottom, against the input, instead of
   floating at the top of an empty screen. margin-auto on the first child
   rather than justify-content: flex-end, which clips the top of the list as
   soon as it does overflow. */
.chat-log > :first-child { margin-top: auto; }
.bubble {
  max-width: 86%; padding: 11px 14px; border-radius: var(--r);
  font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.55; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;
}
/* A URL inside a reply, not the top-bar/card links elsewhere - underlined in
   the bubble's own ink rather than default link-blue, which would fight the
   four lights instead of sitting inside them. */
.bubble a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--edge-soft); }
.bubble.me a { text-decoration-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }
.bubble.me {
  align-self: flex-end; color: var(--me-ink); font-weight: 500;
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--me-a), var(--me-b));
  border-bottom-right-radius: 6px;
  box-shadow: var(--e1);
}
.bubble.bot {
  align-self: flex-start; color: var(--text);
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  background-image: linear-gradient(var(--pane-2), var(--pane-2)),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--edge), transparent 60%);
  background-origin: border-box; background-clip: padding-box, border-box;
  border-bottom-left-radius: 6px;
}
.bubble.tool {
  align-self: flex-start; max-width: 92%;
  font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  font-size: 0.71rem; color: var(--text-faint);
  background: none; border: none; padding: 2px 2px 2px 6px;
  border-left: 2px solid var(--edge-soft); border-radius: 0;
  white-space: pre-wrap; opacity: 0.75;
}
.bubble.err { color: var(--bad); }
.bubble.pending { color: var(--text-faint); font-style: italic; }

.chat-form {
  display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-end; flex-shrink: 0;
  padding: 10px; border-radius: var(--r);
  margin-bottom: calc(var(--tabbar-h) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) + 10px);
}
.chat-form textarea {
  flex: 1; min-width: 0; font: inherit; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text);
  background: none; border: none; resize: none; max-height: 30vh;
  padding: 8px 4px; line-height: 1.45;
}
.chat-form textarea:focus { outline: none; }
.send-btn {
  width: 38px; height: 38px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 50%;
  border: none; background: var(--accent); color: var(--me-ink); cursor: pointer;
  display: grid; place-items: center;
}
.send-btn svg { width: 19px; height: 19px; }
.send-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.35; }

/* --- device panel ------------------------------------------------------ */

.device-info {
  display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 14px; font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 14px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.device-info span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }

.device-stage {
  position: relative; border-radius: var(--r); overflow: hidden;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.85); border: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
  box-shadow: var(--e2);
  max-height: 62vh; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; place-items: center;
}
/* Both pictures occupy the same box: the still underneath, the live frames
   over it. The live layer fades in only once a frame has actually decoded,
   so the stage never blinks to black while the video starts. */
.device-stage .layer {
  position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
  object-fit: contain; touch-action: manipulation;
  opacity: 0; transition: opacity 260ms ease;
}
.device-stage .layer.on { opacity: 1; }
.device-stage video.layer { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.85); }
.stage-wake {
  position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%,-50%);
  z-index: 4;
}

/* Fullscreen. The Fullscreen API does the work where it exists; this class
   does the same job on its own for iOS Safari, which refuses the API for
   anything that is not a <video>. Both are driven by the same toggle, so the
   picture behaves identically either way. */
body.stage-fs { overflow: hidden; }
body.stage-fs .device-stage {
  position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 90;
  max-height: none; border-radius: 0; border: none; margin: 0;
  width: 100vw; height: 100vh; height: 100dvh;
}
body.stage-fs .topbar, body.stage-fs .tabbar { display: none; }
.device-stage:fullscreen { max-height: none; border-radius: 0; }
.fs-bar {
  position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) + 14px);
  transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 95;
  display: flex; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;
  max-width: 96vw; padding: 7px;
  border-radius: 999px; background: var(--pane-solid);
  /* Fades out of the way; any touch on the stage brings it back. */
  opacity: 0.32; transition: opacity 220ms ease;
}
.fs-bar:hover, body.stage-fs .device-stage:active .fs-bar, .fs-bar:focus-within { opacity: 1; }
body.stage-fs .stage-badge { opacity: 0.35; }
.stage-empty { color: var(--text-faint); font-size: 0.85rem; padding: 40px; }
.stage-badge {
  position: absolute; top: 10px; left: 10px; z-index: 2;
  font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--code-bg); color: var(--text-dim);
}
.stage-badge.live { color: var(--me-ink); background: var(--good); font-weight: 700; }
.stagebar { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin: 10px 0 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

.tap-ripple {
  position: absolute; width: 34px; height: 34px; margin: -17px 0 0 -17px;
  border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid var(--accent); pointer-events: none;
  animation: ripple 620ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.3,1) forwards; z-index: 3;
}
@keyframes ripple {
  from { transform: scale(0.3); opacity: 0.95; }
  to { transform: scale(1.5); opacity: 0; }
}

.device-controls { margin-bottom: 6px; }
.toolpanel:empty { display: none; }
.toolpanel {
  border-radius: var(--r-sm); padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  background-image: linear-gradient(var(--pane), var(--pane)),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--edge), transparent 70%);
  background-origin: border-box; background-clip: padding-box, border-box;
}
.toolpanel .hint { margin-bottom: 10px; }
.kv { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.7; }
.kv b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
.list-line {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;
  padding: 9px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
  font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-dim);
}
.list-line:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.list-line .who { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
.list-line .when { color: var(--text-faint); font-size: 0.72rem; white-space: nowrap; }

/* --- cost tab ---------------------------------------------------------- */

.balance {
  position: relative; border-radius: var(--r); padding: 24px 20px;
  margin-bottom: 18px; text-align: center; overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(165deg, var(--hero-a), var(--hero-b)),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--edge), transparent 60%);
  background-origin: border-box; background-clip: padding-box, border-box;
  box-shadow: var(--e2);
}
.balance .amount {
  font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 200; letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; line-height: 1;
  color: var(--accent);
}
.balance .amount.low { color: var(--gold); }
.balance .cap { font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-faint); margin-bottom: 14px; }
.balance .sub { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin: 12px 0 18px; }
.meter {
  height: 4px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--edge-soft);
  overflow: hidden; margin: 16px 0 0;
}
.meter i { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 999px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--violet)); }
.meter.warn i { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--bad)); }
.topup {
  display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--me-ink); background: var(--accent); border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 11px 22px; box-shadow: var(--e1);
}

/* --- tab bar ----------------------------------------------------------- */

.tabbar {
  position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 40;
  display: flex; border-radius: 0; border-width: 1px 0 0 0;
  padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
}
.tab {
  flex: 1; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-faint);
  font: inherit; font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
  padding: 10px 2px; height: var(--tabbar-h);
  transition: color 200ms ease;
}
.tab svg { width: 21px; height: 21px; stroke-width: 1.6; }
.tab.active { color: var(--accent); }
.tab span { transition: opacity 200ms ease; }

/* --- sheet ------------------------------------------------------------- */

.sheet-wrap { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 70; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; }
.sheet-wrap.hidden { display: none; }
.sheet-scrim { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: var(--scrim);
}
.sheet {
  position: relative; width: 100%; max-height: 82vh; overflow-y: auto;
  border-radius: var(--r) var(--r) 0 0; border-width: 1px 0 0 0;
  padding: 10px var(--pad) calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) + 22px);
  box-shadow: var(--e3);
  animation: rise 280ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.8,0.25,1);
}
@keyframes rise { from { transform: translateY(18px); opacity: 0; } }
.sheet-grip {
  width: 38px; height: 4px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--edge);
  margin: 4px auto 14px;
}
.sheet-item {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; width: 100%;
  padding: 15px 6px; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
  font: inherit; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text); text-align: left;
}
.sheet-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.sheet-item .si-sub { margin-left: auto; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-faint);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.sheet-item.on { color: var(--accent); }

/* --- modal ------------------------------------------------------------- */

.modal { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 80; display: grid; place-items: center;
  background: var(--scrim); padding: var(--pad); }
.modal.hidden { display: none; }
.modal-box { width: 100%; max-width: 380px; border-radius: var(--r); padding: 24px; }
.modal-box h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.1rem; }
.modal-box input {
  width: 100%; font: inherit; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text);
  background: var(--pane); border: 1px solid var(--edge-soft);
  border-radius: var(--r-sm); padding: 12px; margin: 12px 0;
}
.modal-box input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--accent); }

/* --- entrance ---------------------------------------------------------- */

.reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
.reveal.in { opacity: 1; transform: none;
  transition: opacity 520ms ease, transform 520ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.8,0.25,1); }

.hidden { display: none !important; }
a { color: var(--accent); }

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
  .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
}

/* fx.js marks staggered entrances with .fx-in and an inline animation-delay;
   this is the animation it is naming. Kept separate from .reveal (which is
   the CSS-only variant) so the two cannot half-apply to the same element. */
.fx-in { animation: fxin 520ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.8,0.25,1) both; }
@keyframes fxin { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); } }

/* The tab bar highlights "Mehr" while any screen behind it is open, so the
   bar never shows nothing selected. */
#more-tab.active { color: var(--accent); }


/* --- Zentrale --------------------------------------------------------------
   Nur das, was es sonst nirgends gibt. Karten, Chips und Zeilen kommen aus
   dem übrigen Blatt, damit ein Materialwechsel diesen Bildschirm mitnimmt,
   ohne dass jemand daran denken muss. */

.worker-row {
  border-left: 3px solid var(--good); padding: 7px 0 7px 10px; margin-bottom: 9px;
}
.worker-row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.worker-who { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.92rem; }
.worker-who .sub { font-weight: 400; margin-left: 5px; }
.worker-what {
  margin-top: 2px;
  display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.cmd-nums { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
.cmd-nums span { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-dim); }
.cmd-nums b {
  display: block; font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--text);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.cmd-sw {
  align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--edge-soft); flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.cmd-sw:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.cmd-sw > span:first-child { flex: 1 1 150px; font-size: 0.88rem; }
.cmd-sw .sub { display: block; margin-top: 1px; }

/* Der Notaus. Das einzige Element mit eigener Farbfläche: er ist nicht eine
   Einstellung unter vielen, sondern das, was man im Zweifel sucht. */
.stop-btn {
  width: 100%; margin: 4px 0 8px; padding: 13px;
  font: inherit; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;
  background: transparent; color: var(--bad);
  border: 2px solid var(--bad); border-radius: var(--r-sm);
}
.stop-btn.on { background: var(--bad); color: var(--bg); }

.svc-bad { color: var(--bad); font-weight: 600; }


/* --- Konsensprüfung ---------------------------------------------------------
   Das Urteil zuerst, die Einzelantworten als Beleg darunter: "sind sie sich
   einig" ist die Frage, wegen der man überhaupt zwei Engines fragt. */
.consensus-verdict {
  font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.consensus-one { margin-bottom: 10px; }
.consensus-one:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.consensus-one b { font-size: 0.8rem; }
.consensus-one .sub { margin-top: 3px; white-space: pre-wrap; }
.bad { color: var(--bad); }
